# {{ecosystem}} Chenile ecosystem

This directory was generated by the `chenile-ecosystem` blueprint.

`pom.xml` is the Maven reactor parent for this ecosystem. Run `mvn install`
from this directory to build every generated artifact. Each generated project
inherits from this parent; its own modules continue to inherit from their
project-level POM.

- `{{service}}` is the HTTP Chenile service.
- `{{monolith}}` packages that service as the primary mini monolith.
{{#includeServiceRegistry}}- `{{serviceRegistryMonolith}}` hosts the Chenile service registry; generated application mini monoliths use it through the service registry delegate at `{{serviceRegistryUrl}}`.
{{/includeServiceRegistry}}{{#includeCconfig}}- cconfig is included in `{{monolith}}`.
{{/includeCconfig}}{{#includeHeadlessService}}- `{{headlessService}}` is the non-HTTP Chenile service and `{{headlessMonolith}}` packages it.
{{/includeHeadlessService}}{{#includeQueryService}}- `{{queryNamespace}}` is the MyBatis query service and `{{queryMonolith}}` packages it with the query controller.
{{/includeQueryService}}

Each generated project has its own README with build and run commands. Configure distinct server ports before running more than one mini monolith at the same time.
